# Riichi rejection for closed noten hand and open tenpai hand (engine.md §4.2, rules.md §1).
# Seat 0 has a closed noten hand (>= 1000 pts, >= 4 live tiles) -> assert_illegal 0: riichi.
# Seat 0 discards 5z -> Seat 1 calls pon:55z and discards 9m, leaving open tenpai (waiting 4s/7s).
# Seats 2, 3, 0 tsumogiri; Seat 1 draws 1z (open tenpai, >= 1000 pts, >= 4 live tiles) -> assert_illegal 1: riichi!
# Seat 1 tsumogiris 1z; Seat 2 draws and discards 7s -> Seat 1 rons 7s (yakuhai_haku 1 han 30 fu = 1000).

[meta]
